<doc node='6ccd131f-f148' rev='145' sinceRev='1'><gap blocks='2'/><paragraph id='msmdgb10h5g.63' rev='1' h='26e9bc8c'><text id='.64'><bold>Thesis</bold></text><text id='.70'>: New command-line tooling in a repository that already uses Python should be written in Python, not Node.js, unless a script needs a Node.js library with no equivalent.</text></paragraph><gone id='mn7ar8et4wz.0' rev='32'/><gone id='.1' rev='33'/><gap blocks='1'/><paragraph id='msmdgb10h5g.259' rev='101' h='4e6383cc'><text id='.260'>Maintainers choosing a runtime for a new tooling script. A </text><text id='mn7ar8et4wz.33'>THIRD</text><text id='msmdgb10h5g.325'> runtime in a repository adds installation and upkeep for every contributor</text><text id='mzpbjtd9exv.0'>s</text><text id='msmdgb10h5g.400'>.</text></paragraph><gap blocks='3'/><table id='.720' rev='145' h='7bd2cc3f'><gap blocks='1'/><row id='.751' rev='52' h='cfc374fb'><gap blocks='1'/><cell id='.788' h='1d9875ef'><paragraph id='.789' h='f6952b46'><text id='.790'>Familiarity favors Node.js for that team; the t</text><text id='mn7ar8et4wz.38'>hesis</text><text id='msmdgb10h5g.842'> assumes the repository's existing runtime is Python</text></paragraph></cell><gap blocks='1'/></row><gone id='.913' rev='89' was='Distribution of a single script '/><gone id='mn7ar8et4wz.60' rev='145' was='Added a third row to be deleted.'/></table><gap blocks='8'/><list id='msmdgb10h5g.1660' rev='144' h='684a6525' kind='bullet'><gap blocks='1'/><listItem id='.1708' h='07e2250c'><gap blocks='1'/><list id='mn7ar8et4wz.45' h='b3e3b48b' kind='bullet'><listItem id='.43' rev='60' h='0abeef90'><paragraph id='.44' h='1df77b76'><text id='.46'>A new subitem.</text></paragraph></listItem><listItem id='mzpbjtd9exv.20' rev='144' h='ff290651'><paragraph id='.21' h='a54878a6'><text id='.22'>New Bullet</text></paragraph></listItem></list></listItem><gone id='mn7ar8et4wz.43' rev='54'/></list></doc>
